cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Ohio Cannabis Ecosystem Directory
message: >-
  If you use this directory, please cite it using the metadata in this file.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Travis
    family-names: Vought
    website: 'https://github.com/travisvought-byte'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/travisvought-byte/ohio-cannabis-directory'
url: 'https://travisvought-byte.github.io/ohio-cannabis-directory/'
abstract: >-
  A source-verified map of organizations operating in or serving Ohio's
  cannabis market, including operators, service providers, nonprofits, and
  cannabis-adjacent organizations, each traced to a named source. Contains
  511 rows: 465 publishable organizations across 16 categories and 46
  deliberately retained out-of-scope records preserving renamed, acquired,
  and superseded organizations. Includes 60 documented
  business-to-business relationships.
keywords:
  - Ohio
  - cannabis
  - business directory
  - market map
  - data provenance
